  "description": "With the Backroad AL GRX RX810 1X11 you can master more demanding off-road conditions. Equipped with the first-class SHIMANO GRX RX810 gravel shift group and 1-speed drivetrain, this bike is ideal for off-road tours that require larger gear jumps. It comes with robust and ROSE G TWENTYFIVE gravel wheels encased in WTB gravel tyres – designed for off-roading. You’ll also be more comfortable with the gravel handlebar’s anatomically-shaped lower bends, which are well-designed for the demands of gravelling. More versatility Doesn’t matter if you’re getting some single-trail action, commuting through the city, or on a bike-packing adventure. Kick it into high gear, go gravel, and experience freedom at its best: the aluminium gravel bike Backroad AL makes it all possible. Where will the next great adventure take you? More adventure No adventure is too big! Thanks to gravel-specific geometry and well-designed features such as the downtube protector and countless attachment points for bottle holders, Anything Cages, or bags, the Backroad AL is the perfect companion for outdoor adventures. Max propulsion down the trail with a tyre clearance of up to 50 mm with 650b wheels or 45 mm with 700c wheels – all great qualities for lots of off-roading fun. More design With the Backroad AL you’ll always look good on the bike. Whether you’re on the way to work or on a gravel track. Show off that ultimate two-wheel swag thanks to the beautiful frame design in carbon-look with smooth seams, clear lines, and a super-clean cockpit, which offers full integration of cables and hoses. * approx. 9.3 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for roasted olive frame, 57 cm, without pedals",
